  "bodyHash": "b35a2cd3ded12d61",
  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/wordmarks/outlined/cracked/f64_wordmark.png\" alt=\"Faithful 64x\">\n<h1 style=\"font-weight:900\"><br>Minecraft 首選的 64x 資源包。</h1>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/faithful-64x-bedrock\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/bedrock_button.png\" alt=\"在此獲取基岩版資源包\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<p>升級 Minecraft 材質的邏輯下一步。就像 Faithful 32x 一樣，這個資源包基於原版藝術風格——以四倍解析度精心重製，並添加了恰到好處的額外細節，為您帶來完美的原版風格 Minecraft 體驗。<br><br>透過直接以 32x 版本為基礎進行材質設計，它在不同資源包之間保持了極佳的一致性，且品質不斷提升。如果您喜歡高細節的資源包，但又希望保留原版的感覺，那麼這個資源包絕對適合您！</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/discord_button.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/website_button.png\" alt=\"官方網站\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">補充資訊：</h1>\n<p>如果您有任何回饋、想回報錯誤，或需要一般性協助，請加入上方的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 伺服器、建立 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Faithful-64x-Java/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issue</a>，或在下方留言。關於商業使用或分發相關問題，請參閱我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252flicense\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">授權條款</a>。<br><br>所有材質與附加元件皆由志工於業餘時間貢獻。任何人都可以透過上方連結的 Discord 伺服器提交材質，或製作 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252faddons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加元件</a> 以在我們的網站上正式上架。開始前，請務必閱讀我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.faithfulpack.net%252fpages%252ftextures%252ff64-texturing-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">材質繪製指南</a>，其中詳細說明了本資源包的藝術風格。<br><br>每個資源包均上架於我們的 <a href=\"faithfulpack.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faithful_resource_pack/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252ffaithful_resource_pack%252fsubmissions%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFaithful-Resource-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>，部分資源包亦上架於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fuser%252ffaithful-resource-pack%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCPEDL</a> 及 <a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/Faithful_Resource_Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forums</a>。<strong>從其他任何網站下載皆為非官方、不受支援且可能存在安全風險！</strong>請記得在網路上保持安全。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我們的其他專案：</h1>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f32_button.png\" alt=\"Faithful 32x\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32_button.png\" alt=\"經典 Faithful 32x\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32j_button.png\" alt=\"經典 Faithful 32x Jappa\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf64j_button.png\" alt=\"經典 Faithful 64x Jappa\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:smaller\">Faithful 是一套開源且由社群驅動的 Minecraft 資源包合集，旨在提供比原版更高解析度的材質，同時忠於原作風格。</div>",
